dLine":351,"line":343},"type":124,"typeText":"∀ {α : Type u_1} {β : List.{u_1} α → Sort u_2} {f : (a : α) → (l : List.{u_1} α) → β l → β (List.cons.{u_1} a l)}\n  {b : β List.nil.{u_1}} {l l' : List.{u_1} α},\n  List.Perm.{u_1} l l' →\n    (∀ {a : α} {l l' : List.{u_1} α} {b : β l} {b' : β l'},\n        List.Perm.{u_1} l l' → HEq.{u_2} b b' → HEq.{u_2} (f a l b) (f a l' b')) →\n      (∀ {a a' : α} {l : List.{u_1} α} {b : β l},\n          HEq.{u_2} (f a (List.cons.{u_1} a' l) (f a' l b)) (f a' (List.cons.{u_1} a l) (f a l b))) →\n        HEq.{u_2} (List.rec.{u_2, u_1} b f l) (List.rec.{u_2, u_1} b f l')","unsafe":false,"value":260,"source":{"code":"theorem Perm.rec_heq {β : List α → Sort _} {f : ∀ a l, β l → β (a :: l)} {b : β []} {l l' : List α}\n    (hl : l ~ l') (f_congr : ∀ {a l l' b b'}, l ~ l' → b ≍ b' → f a l b ≍ f a l' b')\n    (f_swap : ∀ {a a' l b}, f a (a' :: l) (f a' l b) ≍ f a' (a :: l) (f a l b)) :\n    @List.rec α β b f l ≍ @List.rec α β b f l' := by\n  induction hl with\n  | nil => rfl\n  | cons a h ih => exact f_congr h ih\n  | swap a a' l => exact f_swap\n  | trans _h₁ _h₂ ih₁ ih₂ => exact ih₁.trans ih₂","start":343,"end":351},"axioms":[]}